---
import { mainnet } from "../../data/site";
import { phone } from "../../data/landing";
import Mark from "../Mark.astro";
---

<section class="intro section-frame" id="about">
  <div class="intro-heading"><span class="section-name">WHY OPENCASH</span><h2>The strategy layer<br /><span>of Hyperliquid.</span></h2></div>
  <div class="phone-stage patterned" aria-label="Illustrative OpenCash terminal preview">
    <div class="phone">
      <div class="phone-top"><span>9:41</span><i></i><span>▰</span></div>
      <div class="phone-brand"><Mark /><span>open cash</span><span class="avatar">OC</span></div>
      <small>USDC balance</small><strong class="phone-balance">1,000<span>.00</span></strong>
      <div class="phone-actions"><span>Test</span><span>Run</span></div>
      <div class="mini-chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 78 16 70 30 74 45 52 59 58 75 36 89 45 105 29 120 38 135 19 150 29 167 12 180 21 199 9 215 15 240 2" /></svg></div>
      <div class="phone-label">Hyperliquid markets <span>{mainnet ? "Mainnet" : "Testnet"}</span></div>
      {phone.markets.map(([symbol, ticker, name]) => (
        <div class="market-row"><span class="coin">{symbol}</span><span><b>{ticker}</b><small>{name}</small></span><span class="market-direction">Long <small>HL</small></span></div>
      ))}
      <div class="phone-label">Thematic bins <span>Explore</span></div><div class="phone-bin">OpenCash Sample Bin <span>↗</span></div>
    </div>
    <span class="preview-caption">Illustrative, not live market data</span>
  </div>
  <div class="intro-bottom">
    <p>Hyperliquid is the exchange. OpenCash is the strategy layer on top of it: themed bins that open several positions in one tap, rule-based bots, and an agent that turns a headline into a trade. Test any of them on real Hyperliquid history and with fake money first. Every order settles on Hyperliquid itself, and the trading key OpenCash holds can trade but never withdraw.</p>
    <ul class="benefits"><li><span aria-hidden="true">▦</span>Strategies, not single orders</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">↻</span>Tested on real Hyperliquid history</li><li><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span>Settles on Hyperliquid</li></ul>
  </div>
</section>
